  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1601.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1601.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to any person who uses or allows the use of the fuels identified in Env-A 1602 at a stationary source or device in the state and to any person who supplies such fuels.\n\nSource. #10415, eff 9-24-13 (from Env-A 1602.01); ss by #13808, eff 11-18-23",
